  "2026-08-09T16:09:43.818Z","harness:codex","PR #952 first hosted pass at exact head 77fb234d4: every required GitHub runner completed successfully, including four coverage shards, static/compat/smoke/typecheck gates, Node 22/24 and macOS/Windows runtimes, CodeQL, Trivy, TruffleHog, Semgrep, ShellCheck, PSScriptAnalyzer, actionlint, CodeFactor, DeepScan, Hound, CodSpeed, and Codecov patch. Thread-aware inventory found zero review threads. CodeRabbit and Sourcery were quota-limited and supplied no code findings; Cubic completed neutral with no findings; no Greptile check/comment surface was emitted. Every bot comment/review was individually reacted to and acknowledged at its GitHub artifact."
